  "script": "I can build something with AI now, get it looking pretty polished, and start thinking I could sell this.\nBut I can get that far before I know why someone would choose it over what they\u2019re already using.\nI\u2019ve got other things I wanna build too, so I want more to go on before I give this one more time.\nSo I\u2019m building what I call a GTM Engine to help me figure that out. It looks at the code behind what I\u2019ve built, then researches who might need it and what they\u2019re using already.\nThat helps me work out what to test. I\u2019d still wanna let someone try what I\u2019ve built on something they actually need to do, and see whether they choose it over their usual way.\nMaybe I\u2019ve gotta build a bit more to find that out. That\u2019s fine. I don\u2019t have to decide it\u2019s a business just to keep working on it.\nAnd if I just enjoy using it myself, I can leave it at that. It\u2019s okay to have a hobby.\nSo you guys tell me, what made you decide to turn something you\u2019d built into a business?\n",
